## 6. 业务侧调用模板

```java
// === Google Maps Place Details（计费）===
GoogleMapsGeocodingClient.PlaceDetailResult r =
    googleMapsGeocodingClient.placeDetails(apiKey, placeId, "zh-CN");
if (!r.ok()) {
    // status: ZERO_RESULTS / OVER_QUERY_LIMIT / REQUEST_DENIED / NETWORK_ERROR
    log.warn("[GOOGLE-MAPS] placeDetails failed: status={} err={}", r.getStatus(), r.getErrorMessage());
}
```

```java
// === 有赞 webhook 验签（待实现接收端）===
@PostMapping("/webhook/youzan")
public Result<Void> handleYouzanWebhook(
        HttpServletRequest request,
        @RequestParam("kdt_id") String kdtId,
        @RequestHeader("X-Youzan-Sign") String signature) {

    // 1. 用 ContentCachingRequestWrapper 读原始 body（避免 Jackson 重排）
    String rawBody = readRawBody(request);
    // 2. 反查平台
    EcommercePlatform pf = platformMapper.selectOne(... kdtId 匹配 ...);
    if (pf == null) return Result.error(BizCode.NOT_FOUND, "未配置有赞店铺");
    // 3. 验签
    if (!YouzanEcommerceAdapter.verifyWebhookSignature(pf.getSignSecret(), rawBody, signature)) {
        return Result.error(BizCode.PERMISSION_DENIED, "签名不匹配");
    }
    // 4. 解析 + 写库
    JsonNode payload = jackson.readTree(rawBody);
    // ... upsert order ...
    return Result.success();
}
```

> ⚠️ `rawBody` 必须在 Jackson 反序列化**之前**缓存，否则字段顺序重排会破坏签名。
